    "updated_at": "2021-07-12T21:33:46Z",
    "body": "Although personally I've found section numbers a bit silly in a living standard (including the main one, not the developer's edition), since they change so frequently, we do seem to be inconsistent here. I'm unsure whether we should delete the section numbers from the table of contents, or add them to the body. Thoughts from the community are welcome.",
