    "updated_at": "2021-07-13T21:59:50Z",
    "body": "Since you can't rely on them staying the same their convenience as any kind of reference might be limited, but I do occasionally appreciate the numbering in the main standard.. Feels like if I appreciate it in one, I would in the other too, and maybe it would be better to match for consistency if there's a toss up without a clear answer?",
